cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file, together with the paper listed under references."
type: software
title: "slopevf: View-factor based irradiation distribution on multi-row bifacial PV arrays on sloped and reflective ground"
abstract: >-
  Python implementation of a view-factor based model for the location-resolved irradiation on
  the front and back side of PV panels in multi-row arrays on arbitrarily sloped, reflective
  ground. All view factors are evaluated in closed form. Includes finite arrays, panel
  thickness, specular and diffuse reflection between the rows, glass transmission and the local
  horizon, a legacy mode reproducing the original MATLAB implementation, and the verification
  and validation studies (Radiance ray tracing, Totalp miniature array).
